  <prompt>Task 186 wired the Console Send Email dialog. Four more composer hosts still pass no template, AI-draft or attachment-upload handlers, so those features are hidden there (Owner D-219 (2026-11-12, notes/decisions.md) Q3; inventory in notes/task-186-notes.md).</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in React, Fluent UI v9 and the @spaarke/ui-components wizard framework (CreateRecordWizard, WizardShell).</role>
  <goal>ComposeWorkspace (memo email), the TrackingFieldTrio PCF (Email Members), the CommunicationPage code page (EmailComposerSlot) and the CommunicationActions PCF pass onListEmailTemplates, onRenderEmailTemplate, onDraftWithAi and onUploadLocalAttachment from one createXrmEmailComposeHandlers instance each.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>notes/task-186-notes.md host table. TrackingFieldTrio already has getEmailHandlers() (index.ts ~1794): reuse it. ComposeWorkspace.tsx ~5390, EmailComposerSlot.tsx ~99 and CommunicationActionsApp.tsx ~576 have authenticatedFetch and bffBaseUrl in scope. Template picker needs BOTH list and render handlers (EmailComposer.tsx:776).</background>
    <relevant-files>
